----------------------------------------------------------------------------
NOTE ON ARTWORK / ASSETS
----------------------------------------------------------------------------
This MIT license covers the *source code* only.

The default character artwork (images under `characters/`, the `icon.ico`
program icon, and `图标.jpg`) is fan-made, AI-generated content provided for
**personal, non-commercial use only**. It is NOT licensed under MIT. The author
does not claim copyright ownership of the underlying character design and makes
no warranty regarding third-party rights. If you are the rights holder of any
asset and object to its inclusion, please open an issue and it will be removed.

To ship your own pet, replace the files in `characters/` with artwork you have
the rights to use.
